			description: [
				"&4由灵魂钢锻造的残骸盔甲具有抗性、耐用性，能防止你被击飞。但它有一个重大缺陷。"
				""
				"到底是哪一个呢？"
				""
				"&4The core of the armour in the chestplate is an embedded crystallized ether piece. If you were to withstand a fatal blow with it, the chestplate would embed itself into your chest."
